00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.580
But also, the filmmaking's quite a bit better too.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.580
It's not just about, like, adding effects onto something,

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.320
it's also, like, how are the effects motivated from the filmmaking perspective

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:07.420
[Niko]: So, like, compared to Supergirl where there's, like, awkward, reanimated retime stuff,

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.700
the camera's all, like, doing really cool stuff,

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:10.680
the rendering's great.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:14.360
They're using, like, good photo-real rendering and good, like, lighting techniques.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.240
