00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:26.420
but you know what, do like full CG characters for TV shows kind of gutsy,

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:27.440
I gotta commend them for it.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.580
[Wren]: Shows are hard to do visual effects for because the budget is way more stretched out.

